{"id":"f262e3cfb0b8ba42","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-real-sequence-coding.md","title":"Coding Countable Sequences of Baire Reals","display":"df-real-sequence-coding — Coding Countable Sequences of Baire Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-real-sequence-coding","aliases":["68-df-real-sequence-coding"],"display":"df-real-sequence-coding — Coding Countable Sequences of Baire Reals","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-pairing-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§19 p.72 / PDF 81; local Cantor pairing adaptation","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-real-sequence-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-real-sequence-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-real-sequence-coding — Coding Countable Sequences of Baire Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3970a22e73ed3ca\" href=\"?note=a3970a22e73ed3ca\" title=\"68-df-pairing-function\">68-df-pairing-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§19 p.72 / PDF 81; local Cantor pairing adaptation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{pair}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3970a22e73ed3ca\" href=\"?note=a3970a22e73ed3ca\" title=\"68-df-pairing-function\">68-df-pairing-function</a> 已核对的递归双射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)\">\\(\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)\\)</span> 是一个实，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是编码整个实序列的实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i):=\\{(j,\\alpha(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j))):j\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma):=\\{(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j),\\Gamma(i)(j)):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i):=\\{(j,\\alpha(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j))):j\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma):=\\{(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j),\\Gamma(i)(j)):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma),i)=\\Gamma(i))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma),i)=\\Gamma(i))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §19，印刷 p.72 / PDF p.81 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha)_x=\\lambda y\\,\\alpha(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\((\\alpha)_x=\\lambda y\\,\\alpha(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>。本目录用已证明为递归双射的 Cantor pair 替代书中的序列编码；这一点是明确的本地实现选择。pair 的单射性保证 join 单值，满射性保证其定义域是所有自然数；逐点计算给出 col(join(Γ),i)=Γ(i)。此 join 与集合的 Turing join 分别使用不同符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-pairing-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3970a22e73ed3ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-pairing-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-pairing-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3970a22e73ed3ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B$，$i,j\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{pair}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是 [[68-df-pairing-function]] 已核对的递归双射。$\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)$ 是一个实，$\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)$ 是编码整个实序列的实。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i):=\\{(j,\\alpha(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j))):j\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma):=\\{(\\mathrm{pair}(i,j),\\Gamma(i)(j)):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\alpha,i)\\in\\mathcal B),\\qquad\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma)\\in\\mathcal B\\land\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\mathrm{col}(\\mathrm{join}_{\\mathcal B}(\\Gamma),i)=\\Gamma(i))).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\alpha)_x=\\lambda y\\,\\alpha(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ed8e054bd690153","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中，$P\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathbb N$、$Q\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为任意关系。$\\mathcal B$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]，$\\mathrm{col}$ 见 [[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]。Assertion 直接使用关系成员式。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-sequence-coding]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-sequence-coding]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-sequence-coding|df-real-sequence-coding — Coding Countable Sequences of Baire Reals]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","a3970a22e73ed3ca"]}